	"FriendlyName": "Dojo FX Tools",
	"Description": "Editor-only helper for the dojo landscape round FX stage: generic reflection get/set (ExportText / ImportText by property path) on any UObject, so the Python build can configure Niagara lightweight (stateless) emitters, whose modules and distribution structs are not exposed to Python; replaces an emitter's renderer; finalises and compiles a Niagara system. Installed into DojoLab only while the FX build step runs.",
